   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No request outlives the load balancer\n\nSubmit returns 202 at once; the browser polls.\nNothing depends on a 60 s ALB idle timeout.",
   "originalText": "No request outlives the load balancer\n\nSubmit returns 202 at once; the browser polls.\nNothing depends on a 60 s ALB idle timeout.",
